<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-11-03T17:58:01.363Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:58:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violence in northern Ethiopia has escalated as the Ethiopian military conducts cross-border drone strikes that prompted Sudan to file formal complaints at the UN and the AU. The WHO warns the health system is near collapse as attacks on civilians continue, including an RPG strike near a school in Moyale that killed 60 Ethiopian Orthodox believers. Kenya has begun registering over 50,000 Ethiopian refugees fleeing the Moyale clashes. There were 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE50YUdFOTZZQ2ROVnp1eHFpYUt4QkhfbV9JRWNyNW5KaHFWWTc1UnNOekdsOUZ3X0VURmxkdzYxYktyU29lbDdwNEdOZnZEWU93VmZxajg0bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
</item>
